        "title": "Eye opening",
        "text": "All you need to do at this attraction is turn up and watch. Have a guide with you if you can to explain what is going on, it is quite something to witness. Watch the monkeys as they are cheeky, especially if you have food and young ones. Im not convinced kids under the age of 16 should really go to this attraction as it is quite graphic what is going on. There is a sense of finality about it. There are lots of Yogis (holy men around) and the smell of Marijuana is in the air, so just keep all this in mind. Well worth the visit though.",
