        "title": "A spiritually charged place",
        "text": "Overall ambience was good. One make sure that he/she has a full darshan of all four faces of the deity and understand the significance of them. Also important to know the history of the temple and its significance w.r.t. Kailash as well as the twelve jotirlingaa. You will surpised to know that the temple was attacked, looted and destroyed by the Mahmud of Ghazni like he did for many other Hindu shrines like Somanath in Gujrat.\n\nIt would be better if one sits in silence in the temple for a while to soak in the engines present rather than bustling through the crowd and be content with just a glimpse of the idol /linga.",
