        "title": "A depressing experience ...",
        "text": "I was clicking away with my camera while wandering through the place and suddenly realized what it was and I became too depressed to continue taking photos. \nThere is a river running through this place and people here brought the bodies of their late relatives here to cremate. The scene is quite depressing. \nHowever, still an interesting place to visit in Kathmandu since it is among the most significant temples compound in Nepal. The Shiva temple looks really magnificent from up hill. So, only Hindus are allowed inside this temple so you can only get to see the temple from the hill across the river.",
